<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<title>Company Verification</title>

<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">

<style>

body{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f2027,#203a43,#2c5364);
    min-height:100vh;
    font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}

.main-card{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    background:white;
    border-radius:25px;
    padding:40px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}

.form-control{
    height:52px;
    border-radius:12px;
}

.form-control:focus{
    box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(25,135,84,.3);
    border-color:#198754;
}

.btn{
    border-radius:12px;
}

.tip-card{
    background:#eef8ff;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:30px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

.tip-card ul{
    padding-left:18px;
}

.tip-card li{
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.footer{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:25px;
    color:#666;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>
<%- include("partials/navbar") %>
<div class="main-card">

<div class="text-center">

<h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-success">

🏢 Company Verification

</h1>

<p class="text-muted fs-5">

Verify whether a company appears genuine before applying for a job.

</p>

</div>

<hr class="mb-4">

<div class="row">

<!-- LEFT SIDE -->

<div class="col-lg-7">

<form action="/verify_company" method="POST">

<div class="mb-4">

<label class="form-label fw-bold">

<i class="bi bi-building"></i>

Company Name

</label>

<input
type="text"
name="company_name"
class="form-control"
placeholder="Microsoft"
required>

</div>

<div class="mb-4">

<label class="form-label fw-bold">

<i class="bi bi-globe"></i>

Company Website

</label>

<input
type="text"
name="website"
class="form-control"
placeholder="https://microsoft.com"
required>

</div>

<div class="mb-4">

<label class="form-label fw-bold">

<i class="bi bi-envelope-fill"></i>

Recruiter Email

</label>

<input
type="email"
name="email"
class="form-control"
placeholder="hr@microsoft.com"
required>

</div>

<div class="text-center mt-4">

<button class="btn btn-success btn-lg px-5 shadow">

✔ Verify Company

</button>


</div>

</form>

</div>

<!-- RIGHT SIDE -->

<div class="col-lg-5">

<div class="tip-card">

<div class="text-center mb-4">

<div style="
width:90px;
height:90px;
background:#198754;
border-radius:50%;
display:inline-flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
font-size:42px;
color:white;
">

🛡️

</div>

</div>

<h2 class="text-center">

Verification Tips

</h2>

<hr>

<ul>

<li>Use the official company website.</li>

<li>Email domain should match the website domain.</li>

<li>HTTPS websites are more trustworthy.</li>

<li>Avoid suspicious domains (.xyz, .top, .click).</li>

<li>Cross-check the company's Careers page.</li>

<li>Never pay money to apply for a job.</li>

<li>Search the company on LinkedIn and Glassdoor.</li>

<li>Verify recruiter information before responding.</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="footer">

Career Verify AI © 2026

</div>

</div>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

</body>

</html>